  "summary": "The controls Hawk AI takes part in for a Dubai government or semi-government entity under DESC ISR v3 (and the UAE IA Standard and India's CERT-In directions), the checklist Settings → Compliance shows, plus the entity's own management-system duties.",
  "scope": "Requirement ids are Hawk AI's DESC checklist ids (AC, LG, IR, CR, SI, DR, AI) and ORG for the entity's own processes; each title names the ISR domain. The ISR's own control numbering is in the regulation as DESC issues it to entities.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Dubai Electronic Security Center: Information Security Regulation",
      "url": "https://www.desc.gov.ae/"
    },
    {
      "title": "UAE Information Assurance Regulation",
      "url": "https://u.ae/en/information-and-services/justice-safety-and-the-law/cyber-safety-and-digital-security/uae-information-assurance-regulation"
    },
    {
      "title": "CERT-In directions under section 70B(6) of the IT Act (28 April 2022)",
      "url": "https://www.cert-in.org.in/"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [],
